  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "After a fight with his longtime lover, Suhyun, Jaeyoon storms out in anger, only to die in a car accident. When he opens his eyes again, his body and memories are intact, but five years have passed. Everything is the same except for one thing: his beloved Suhyun. Suhyun, now cold and distant, refuses to believe that Jaeyoon has truly returned. Determined to prove himself, Jaeyoon tries to reach him in any way he can, but instead finds himself bearing the full weight of Suhyun’s grief and fury.\n\n*“If you really wanted to live… you shouldn’t have left me like that.”*\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065477)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/panacea_breakup)",
